    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Earlier text already groups legend Gu such as Wisdom Gu with rank nine Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          561
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inside Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Mo Yao’s will confirms that one supreme true inheritance holds the rank nine Wisdom Gu. Approaching it ages Fang Yuan at once. The same passage states that using Wisdom Gu costs lifespan, matching the Ren Zu bargains that traded middle age for its help, and that Giant Sun Immortal Venerable sealed it there. Fang Yuan does not know how Giant Sun obtained it or sealed it.",
        "chapters": [
          601
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
          "char_mo_yao",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When the building collapses, Wisdom Gu gives off the light of wisdom. Under that light, thoughts form, collide, and break at extreme speed, which the text names as the true effect of Wisdom Gu and as the principle behind the wisdom path.",
        "chapters": [
          637
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_wisdom"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At the end of that crisis, Wisdom Gu flies to Fang Yuan of its own accord.",
        "chapters": [
          649
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He brings it through a stargate into Hu Immortal blessed land. He has not refined it. Survival instinct brought it with him, and he can use a portion of the light of wisdom; his immortal zombie body has no lifespan for that light to burn.",
        "chapters": [
          651
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He has no choice but to expose Wisdom Gu to Lang Ya land spirit out of necessity, and the land spirit persuades Wisdom Gu into a hairy man Gu Immortal’s immortal aperture and relocates it to Lang Ya blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          1028
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
          "sys_gu_immortal",
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later recounting places Wisdom Gu in Eighty-Eight True Yang Building under Giant Sun, for whom ransacking Northern Plains for lifespan Gu was one of the building’s most important purposes and feeding it only secondary, and adds that Spectral Soul Demon Venerable once found it there but could neither use it nor afford to feed it.",
        "chapters": [
          1074
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_northern_plains",
          "gu_lifespan_gu",
          "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Its food is lifespan Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1083
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-nine-immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the oldest legend it is the most beautiful of the three Gu that bargain with Ren Zu.",
        "chapters": [
          5
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": []
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": false,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": []
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Heavenly Court records state that after Star Constellation Immortal Venerable became rank nine, she spent close to one hundred years to subdue and refine rank nine Wisdom Gu. Fairy Zi Wei later treats that history as fact: Wisdom Gu was refined by Star Constellation Immortal Venerable,",
        "chapters": [
          1557
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "star-constellations-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
          "char_fairy_zi_wei"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "and the refinement process sits in Star Constellation’s true inheritance.",
        "chapters": [
          1580
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "star-constellations-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "inh_star_constellation_true_inheritance"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later Gu Immortal talk repeats that Star Constellation took a hundred years to refine a wild rank nine Wisdom Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2245
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "star-constellations-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Those passages do not narrate the handoff from Star Constellation’s era into Giant Sun’s seal inside Eighty-Eight True Yang Building.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "star-constellations-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit adds that legend places large amounts of information path immortal materials in Wisdom Gu’s recipe, and that a wild Wisdom Gu can only finish advancement in areas rich in information path dao marks. The recipe itself is not in Spectral Soul’s or Lang Ya’s true inheritances; only Heavenly Court holds some records.",
        "chapters": [
          1562
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "star-constellations-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_lang_ya_sect"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
